<section class="band statement" id="statement" aria-label="Introduction">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p id="statementText">Growth rarely fails because of the product. It fails on decisions: who to sell to, what to say, where to invest and what to stop. I have made those calls in my own businesses for 25 years. Now I help tech leaders, and the investors who back them, make them well.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band who-band" id="who" aria-labelledby="who-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="pe-head">
      <h2 class="h-sec" id="who-h">Who I work with</h2>
      <p>Founders and CEOs running B2B technology companies, and the investors who fund them.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="who-grid">
      <article class="who-card">
        <h3>Tech leaders</h3>
        <p class="who-sub">Founders, CEOs and leadership teams of B2B technology companies.</p>
        <p class="who-label">You will recognise this</p>
        <ul class="pains">
          <li>Growth has slowed and nobody agrees why.</li>
          <li>Marketing is busy, but the pipeline is thin.</li>
          <li>Sales, marketing and product are pulling in different directions.</li>
          <li>You need a credible growth plan before the next round.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="who-out"><span>What changes</span>You know which customers to go after and what to say to them. Marketing produces pipeline. Sales, marketing and product work to the same plan.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="who-card inv">
        <h3>Investors</h3>
        <p class="who-sub">VC, private equity and private investors backing B2B technology.</p>
        <p class="who-label">You will recognise this</p>
        <ul class="pains">
          <li>A portfolio company is missing its growth plan.</li>
          <li>You want an independent view of the commercial engine before you invest.</li>
          <li>A new investment needs its growth plan sharpened, and quickly.</li>
          <li>The value creation case depends on growth the team has not yet delivered.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="who-out"><span>What changes</span>An honest view of whether the growth story holds up, and a plan management can deliver.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band dark services" id="services" aria-labelledby="svc-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="pe-head">
      <h2 class="h-sec" id="svc-h">What you get</h2>
      <p>Three ways I help tech leaders grow, and one built for investors. Most clients start with a go-to-market review.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="svc-grid">
      <article class="svc">
        <p class="svc-label">For tech leaders</p>
        <h3>Go-to-market strategy</h3>
        <p class="for">Know which customers to go after, what to say to them and how to sell.</p>
        <p class="get">What you get</p>
        <ul class="svc-list"><li>Ideal customer and segment priorities</li><li>Positioning and a proposition buyers understand</li><li>Pricing and packaging review</li><li>The right sales motion and channels</li><li>A growth accelerator programme, built around where you are today</li></ul>
        <p class="eng"><span>How it usually runs</span>Starts with a go-to-market review, scoped with you on a discovery call.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="svc">
        <p class="svc-label">For tech leaders</p>
        <h3>Marketing that builds pipeline</h3>
        <p class="for">Turn marketing activity into qualified pipeline and revenue.</p>
        <p class="get">What you get</p>
        <ul class="svc-list"><li>Messaging senior buyers respond to</li><li>A demand and pipeline model tied to revenue targets</li><li>Content, channel and partner plan</li><li>Visibility in AI search and answer engines</li><li>Reporting your board can trust</li></ul>
        <p class="eng"><span>How it usually runs</span>Strategy from me, delivered with Digital Clarity's team where needed.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="svc">
        <p class="svc-label">For tech leaders</p>
        <h3>Execution and commercial leadership</h3>
        <p class="for">Experienced leadership to carry the plan through.</p>
        <p class="get">What you get</p>
        <ul class="svc-list"><li>Hands-on leadership of sales and marketing</li><li>Sales, marketing and product aligned to one plan</li><li>The right commercial team and structure</li><li>Agencies and partners selected and held to account</li><li>Monthly progress against agreed measures</li></ul>
        <p class="eng"><span>How it usually runs</span>Monthly retained, or a fractional executive role.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="svc inv">
        <p class="svc-label">For investors</p>
        <h3>Commercial due diligence and portfolio growth</h3>
        <p class="for">Know whether the growth story holds up, then help deliver it.</p>
        <p class="get">What you get</p>
        <ul class="svc-list"><li>Pre-deal commercial and go-to-market assessment</li><li>Proposition, market and competitor review</li><li>A portfolio accelerator for companies that are behind plan</li><li>Go-to-market reviews across the portfolio</li><li>Ongoing support for portfolio leadership teams</li></ul>
        <p class="eng"><span>How it usually runs</span>Deal by deal, or retained across a portfolio.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band how" id="how" aria-labelledby="how-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="pe-head">
      <h2 class="h-sec" id="how-h">How it works</h2>
      <p>It starts with a call. There is no long contract before you know the work is worth it.</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="how-steps">
      <li><span class="sn">01</span><h3>A discovery call</h3><p>We talk through the growth decision or problem in front of you, whether I am the right person to help, and the scope of a review.</p></li>
      <li><span class="sn">02</span><h3>A go-to-market review</h3><p>An agreed, focused look at your customers, proposition, pipeline, pricing and team. You get a clear view of what is working, what isn't and what to do next, presented to your leadership team or board.</p></li>
      <li><span class="sn">03</span><h3>Delivery</h3><p>I stay to lead or support the plan, monthly or in a fractional role. When a programme needs a team, Digital Clarity provides it.</p></li>
    </ol>
    <a class="pill dark-pill" href="#contact">Book a discovery call</a>
  </div>
</section>

